    <item>
      <title>Gasba Forever: The Next Phase of Algeria’s Millenia-Old Folk Tradition</title>
      <link>https://daily.bandcamp.com/features/my-heart-is-dust-before-him-21st-century-gasba-from-algeria-feature</link>
